\newlabel{fig:probability}{{2}{4}{Cloud-blockage sensitivity at $\lambda _{\rm ref}$: (a) mean usable SKR and (b) zero-SKR unavailability for P2, Greedy, and DP. All eight probabilities $p=0.1,0.2,\ldots ,0.8$ use 100 paired missions with common innovations. Bands are pointwise 95\% whole-mission bootstrap intervals. Unavailability counts zero usable SKR, without an engineering threshold; neither panel is the optimized penalized objective}{figure.2}{}}
