\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Evaluated usable-SKR--distance tradeoff for Greedy and DP, with P2 as the stationary reference, under default clouds. Curves connect the ten saved penalties in their original increasing order; DP annotations identify zero and representative penalties. Error bars are pointwise 95\% intervals for each mean, not joint confidence regions. Coincident high-penalty DP points and the P2 reference are retained. These conditional model outputs are not claimed to be global physical Pareto frontiers.}}{6}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:tradeoff}{{4}{6}{Evaluated usable-SKR--distance tradeoff for Greedy and DP, with P2 as the stationary reference, under default clouds. Curves connect the ten saved penalties in their original increasing order; DP annotations identify zero and representative penalties. Error bars are pointwise 95\% intervals for each mean, not joint confidence regions. Coincident high-penalty DP points and the P2 reference are retained. These conditional model outputs are not claimed to be global physical Pareto frontiers}{figure.4}{}}
